> Umm, I don't believe that's quite the case.  I seem to recall that warning
> is based strictly on the highest level of all monsters in the vicinity as
> compared with your own level.
> 
> It ranges from White and Light Blue (not really much of a challenge) to 
> Purple and Black (Run Away!).  I'm afraid I don't have specific numbers to
> attach to these; someone with access to the source can figure it out.

Light blue is a special case. It only happens with Sting. Sting hates orcs
(of all types) so it warns you if there are any nearby by glowing light
blue. All other warning is associated with more powerful monsters, and
ranges from white to black through a variety of shades of red, with the
darker colors signifying the most powerful monsters.

